  'After visiting the pharmacy, enter how you were told to take each medication. CivCare will remind you for every dose and check in once each evening to see how you are doing.': ['Baada ya kwenda duka la dawa, weka jinsi ulivyoambiwa umeze kila dawa. CivCare itakukumbusha kila dozi na kukuuliza hali yako kila jioni.', 'Ukitoka chemist, weka vile uliambiwa umeze kila dawa. CivCare itakukumbusha kila doz na ikuulize uko aje kila jioni.'],
