  'Take your time. There is no right or wrong answer. This helps keep your treatment follow-up connected to how you are actually doing.': ['Chukua muda wako. Hakuna jibu sahihi wala lisilo sahihi. Hii husaidia ufuatiliaji wa matibabu yako uendane na hali yako halisi.', 'Chukua time yako. Hakuna jibu wrong. Hii inasaidia follow-up ya matibabu iende na vile uko kweli.'],
