  'Tick the box to agree, or sign out.': S('Weka alama kwenye kisanduku kukubali, au toka.'),
  'Could not save your choice. Check your connection and try again.': ['Imeshindikana kuhifadhi chaguo lako. Kagua mtandao wako na ujaribu tena.', 'Choice yako haijasave. Cheki network alafu jaribu tena.'],
  "Choose 4 digits that aren't easy to guess, like 1234 or 0000.": ['Chagua tarakimu 4 zisizo rahisi kukisia, si kama 1234 au 0000.', 'Chagua namba 4 haziwezi guessiwa rahisi, si kama 1234 ama 0000.'],
  'Could not save your PIN. Try again.': ['Imeshindikana kuhifadhi PIN yako. Jaribu tena.', 'PIN yako haijasave. Jaribu tena.'],
  'Before you continue': S('Kabla hujaendelea'),
  'CivCare has a privacy notice that explains how your health information is used. In short:': S('CivCare ina taarifa ya faragha inayoeleza jinsi taarifa zako za afya zinavyotumiwa. Kwa ufupi:'),
  "The health assistant uses what you tell it to guide you. It doesn't diagnose you or decide for you.": S('Msaidizi wa afya hutumia unachomwambia ili kukuongoza. Hakupi utambuzi wala hakuamulii.'),
  'Only the doctors caring for you can open your file, and every time they do is recorded.': S('Ni madaktari wanaokuhudumia pekee wanaoweza kufungua faili lako, na kila wanapofanya hivyo hurekodiwa.'),
  'What you type is sent to an AI service in the USA. Your phone and ID number are not.': S('Unachoandika hutumwa kwa huduma ya AI iliyoko Marekani. Nambari yako ya simu na ya kitambulisho haitumwi.'),
  'You can download, correct or delete your information at any time from Profile.': S('Unaweza kupakua, kurekebisha au kufuta taarifa zako wakati wowote kupitia Wasifu.'),
  'Read the full privacy notice': S('Soma taarifa kamili ya faragha'),
  'I have read the privacy notice and agree to CivCare using my health information this way.': S('Nimesoma taarifa ya faragha na ninakubali CivCare itumie taarifa zangu za afya kwa njia hii.'),
  'Agree and continue': S('Kubali uendelee'),
  "Your ID number alone isn't enough to keep your health records safe, so you'll now sign in with a 4-digit PIN as well. Don't reuse your M-Pesa PIN.": S('Nambari ya kitambulisho pekee haitoshi kulinda rekodi zako za afya, kwa hivyo sasa utaingia pia kwa PIN ya tarakimu 4. Usitumie PIN yako ya M-Pesa.'),
