  'consent.after': ['and agree that CivCare may use my health information to guide me and share it with the doctors I choose. This includes sending what I type to an AI service outside Kenya.', 'na ninakubali CivCare itumie taarifa zangu za afya kunielekeza na kuzishiriki na madaktari ninaowachagua. Hii inajumuisha kutuma ninachoandika kwa huduma ya AI iliyo nje ya Kenya.', 'na ninakubali CivCare itumie taarifa zangu za afya kunielekeza na kuzishiriki na madaktari ninaowachagua. Hii inajumuisha kutuma ninachoandika kwa huduma ya AI iliyo nje ya Kenya.'],
  'consent.after.child': ['and agree that CivCare may use their health information to guide them and share it with the doctors they choose. This includes sending what they type to an AI service outside Kenya.', 'na ninakubali CivCare itumie taarifa zake za afya kumwelekeza na kuzishiriki na madaktari anaowachagua. Hii inajumuisha kutuma anachoandika kwa huduma ya AI iliyo nje ya Kenya.', 'na ninakubali CivCare itumie taarifa zake za afya kumwelekeza na kuzishiriki na madaktari anaowachagua. Hii inajumuisha kutuma anachoandika kwa huduma ya AI iliyo nje ya Kenya.'],
  'notice.before': ['CivCare follows the Kenya Data Protection Act 2019. Read the', 'CivCare inafuata Sheria ya Ulinzi wa Data ya Kenya 2019. Soma', 'CivCare inafuata Sheria ya Ulinzi wa Data ya Kenya 2019. Soma'],
  'notice.after': ['to see what we collect, who sees it, and your rights.', 'ujue tunachokusanya, nani anakiona, na haki zako.', 'ujue tunachokusanya, nani anakiona, na haki zako.'],
